      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "CairoSVG is an SVG converter based on Cairo, a 2D graphics library. Prior to Kozea/CairoSVG has exponential denial of service via recursive \u003cuse\u003e element amplification in cairosvg/defs.py. This causes CPU exhaustion from a small input.",
